msgstr "Da questa parte."

msgctxt "3176"
msgid ""
"Hello, hello! Thanks for your investment! Did you see my email? The tuna are"
" coming along great! Just great!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3188"
msgid "Are you sure everything's all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3200"
msgid ""
"Oh, totally! We'll be getting amazing dividends in only a year! And as an "
"investor, you get all the tuna you can eat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3212"
msgid ""
"That'll put you in a pinch, eh, chef? All-you-can-eat tuna! Hahaha! That'd "
"be quite the problem for you, am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3224"
msgid "Hahaha... Yeah, right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3236"
msgid ""
"Well, I have an investors' meeting to attend, so if you'll excuse me... I'm "
"just so busy these days!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3248"
msgid "Hehehe."
msgstr "Eh eh eh."

msgctxt "3308"
msgid "Sorry, chef. I've gotta go."
