msgid "Welcome, welcome! Come on in! What can I make for you today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4832"
msgid ""
"We have some beautiful tuna⑬red meat, fatty belly, seared cheek, you name "
"it! How about it? Care to try our tuna today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4844"
msgid "No, thanks. I'll get something else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4856"
msgid "You got it! What are you in the mood for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4880"
msgid "That does sound delicious. Sure, then. The tuna."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4892"
msgid "You got it! One \"tuna medley,\" comin' right up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4904"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4916"
msgid ""
"The tuna they got here today is just so damn good. 'Course, they got their "
"stock from me, but even so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4928"
msgid "Oh, sorry to butt in like that. The name's Sawada."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4940"
msgid "I guess you could call me a tuna professional. I run a fishery."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4952"
msgid ""
"When I see someone who loves good tuna, well, I just have to speak up! I "
"hope I'm not bothering you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4964"
msgid "No, not at all."
msgstr "No, per niente."

msgctxt "4976"
msgid ""
"But you⑬you're a big tuna fan, am I right? Heck, I can tell just by looking "
"at you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4988"
msgid ""
"The real tuna connoisseurs are the ones who always go after the nicely "
"marbled meat⑬they always look tough!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5000"
msgid "Interesting take."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5012"
msgid ""
"But you know... You'd better get your tuna eating in now before it's too "
"late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5024"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "5036"
msgid "They're disappearing from our oceans!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5048"
msgid ""
"I heard this big shot scholar guy say that if we keep fishing tuna like we "
"have been, they'll be extinct in the near future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5060"
msgid ""
"Now that you mention it, I think I remember hearing something like that in "
"the news..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5072"
msgid ""
"So now we've got a problem where you wanna enjoy your tuna, but you can't, "
"in good conscience, fish for 'em. Real killer dilemma, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5084"
msgid "It's a tough situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5096"
msgid ""
"But all hope is not lost! That's where tuna farming comes in. Ever heard of "
"that? Maybe on the news or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5108"
msgid "No, that's a new one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5120"
msgid ""
"C'mon, you've gotta pay attention to the news! Why, tuna is a jewel of the "
"sea! Isn't that right, chef?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5132"
msgid ""
"If a sushi chef runs out of tuna, he may as well close up shop for the day. "
"Tuna's a jewel all right. The backbone of our sushi economy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5144"
msgid ""
"See? That's exactly what I mean! So tuna farming is the way of the future! "
"Farmed tuna will save Japan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5156"
msgid ""
"And I'm thinking of using my fishery to face the challenge of tuna farming "
"head-on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5168"
msgid ""
"We have this special food for tuna, too. It's guaranteed to fatten 'em up "
"bigger than you've ever seen in only half a year!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5180"
msgid ""
"I'm looking for investors at 10,000 yen a pop for what I call the \"Tuna "
"Fund.\" Catchy name, don'cha think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5192"
msgid ""
"With enough investors, I can expand the tuna farm. Once we start bringing in"
" the big money, we'll all take a share."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5204"
msgid ""
"So? Want to invest in the Tuna Fund? Get your wallet fatter than one of my "
"fish? You'll never find a juicier opportunity, I can tell you that much!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5216"
msgid ""
"Knock it off. If you want to talk somebody's ear off, try doing it out by "
"the theater."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5228"
msgid ""
"Huh? But... it's tuna we're talking about here! We'll be drowning in cash in"
" no time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5240"
msgid "Check, please. I can't enjoy my sushi with all this noise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5252"
msgid "I'm sorry, sir. It's on me today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5264"
msgid "Thanks. See you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5276"
msgid ""
"I'll be waiting here... Come on back when you wanna reap the bounty of the "
"sea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5312"
msgid "I suppose it won't hurt to invest a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5324"
msgid "Aw, c'mon. Don't be shy! A real man should dive in head first!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5336"
msgid ""
"They're even starting to eat sashimi in China, don't you know? Tuna sales "
"are going through the roof!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5348"
msgid ""
"Tuna hauls are shrinking, but more and more people are eating it. The price "
"is gonna soar any day now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5360"
msgid ""
"That's where my company's farmed tuna comes in! If we raise 'em up nice and "
"big and then sell 'em off, we'll be rich in no time!"
msgstr ""

